 Tiny Tina guides you through a tabletop-style realm in which rules mean very little. You create a multiclass hero, then use guns, spells and melee weapons against outlandish monsters, collecting loot in dungeons and across a large overworld, on a mission to take down the tyrannical Dragon Lord.\n\nHumor and chaos define the tone, with cross-platform multiplayer for partying up with friends, or the option to play alone. LAN co-op is supported. It suits fans of loot-driven shooters who enjoy a silly fantasy setting and like combining ranged and magic builds."}}